# 36. Final Engineering Principle

Build this application as if it will eventually become a large commercial marketplace.

Prioritize:

1. Maintainability
2. UX quality
3. Type safety
4. Performance
5. Accessibility
6. Testing
7. CI/CD
8. Deployment flexibility
9. Clean API integration
10. Consistent design system

Do not optimize for the fastest possible initial code.

Optimize for a clean codebase that remains easy to develop six months and two years from now.
